{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":20.16},{"sectionId":"build","start":21.36,"end":39.52},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.92,"end":53.36}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.24,"text":"早期 Web 透過連結文件，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.32,"end":4.56,"text":"讓不同電腦上的人分享資訊。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.28,"end":10.24,"text":"HTML 至今仍描述內容的意義：標題引入段落，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.56,"end":13.12,"text":"article 集中一件獨立內容。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.76,"end":16,"text":"作品集已有作品區塊，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":16.16,"end":17.84,"text":"現在需要主標題，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":18.16,"end":20.16,"text":"告訴訪客看到的是什麼。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":21.36,"end":22.8,"text":"把 /index."},{"sectionId":"build","start":22.96,"end":27.12,"text":"html 的標題註解改成 <h1>我的作品集</h1>。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":27.92,"end":30.024,"text":"確認作品標題仍位於主標題之下。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":30.096,"end":30.56,"text":"保留檔案，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":30.8,"end":34.88,"text":"後面章節會加入它連結的樣式與程式。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":35.2,"end":37.72,"text":"為什麼使用 h1，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":37.84,"end":39.52,"text":"而不是放大一段文字？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.92,"end":42.2,"text":"為什麼使用 h1，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.32,"end":44.16,"text":"而不是放大一段文字？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.64,"end":48.76,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":49.04,"end":53.36,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}